# The build script (build.rs) compiles helper/hq-tray-helper.swift into
# helper/hq-tray-helper INSIDE this watched directory. Without this ignore,
# `tauri dev` sees that write as a source change and restarts the build,
# which reruns the build script, which rewrites the helper — an infinite
# rebuild loop (772 cycles observed before this file existed; `tauri dev`
# never completed a single build on this repo).
helper/hq-tray-helper
